a\"><span class=\"duration\"><span class=\"min\">40</span>:<span class=\"s\">55</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Label</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Saint/Soul_Note\" title=\"Black Saint/Soul Note\">Soul Note</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Producer</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Max_Roach\" title=\"Max Roach\">Max Roach</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header description\" style=\"color: #202122;background-color: lightsteelblue\"><a href=\"/wiki/Max_Roach\" title=\"Max Roach\">Max Roach</a> chronology</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"color:inherit; background: transparent; width: 100%; min-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; display: inline-table;\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"line-height: 1.4em;\">\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em .1em .2em 0\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Easy_Winners_(album)\" title=\"Easy Winners (album)\">Easy Winners</a></i><br />(1985)\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em .1em\"><i><b>Bright Moments</b></i><br />(1986)\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33%; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; padding: .2em 0 .2em .1em\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Max_%2B_Dizzy:_Paris_1989\" title=\"Max + Dizzy: Paris 1989\">Max + Dizzy: Paris 1989</a></i><br />(1989)\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i><b>Bright Moments</b></i> is an album by American jazz drummer <a href=\"/wiki/Max_Roach\" title=\"Max Roach\">Max Roach</a>, recorded in 1986 for the Italian <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Saint/Soul_Note\" title=\"Black Saint/Soul Note\">Soul Note</a> label.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Max&#95;Roach&#95;discography&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Max_Roach_discography-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></su